WEBVTT

00:06.170 --> 00:10.180
<i>I can't believe Ray is 
the Iceblade Sorcerer...</i>

00:10.810 --> 00:14.120
<i>one of the Seven Grands, 
the best of the best.</i>

00:15.070 --> 00:16.660
<i>He's not like me.</i>

00:16.660 --> 00:19.370
<i>He's overcome a cruel past.</i>

00:19.370 --> 00:21.210
<i>Just what I'd expect from you, Amelia!</i>

00:21.210 --> 00:22.650
<i>The eldest daughter of the House Rose,</i>

00:22.650 --> 00:24.240
<i>the leader of the three greatest families.</i>

00:24.240 --> 00:26.680
<i>Not just a noble bloodline, 
but also the promise of a bright future!</i>

00:26.680 --> 00:28.670
<i>So wonderful!</i>

00:30.620 --> 00:32.630
<i>They can expect all they want,</i>

00:32.630 --> 00:35.000
<i>but I'll never amount to anything.</i>

00:35.560 --> 00:36.900
<i>In reality, I'm completely empty inside.</i>

00:36.900 --> 00:37.850
<i>Just like a...</i>

00:38.850 --> 00:40.800
<i>...a bird in a cage.</i>

00:42.270 --> 00:44.960
Ow, my eyes!

00:44.960 --> 00:46.140
My eyes!

00:50.360 --> 00:53.690
Anyway, that Ray...

00:55.130 --> 00:57.440
Isn't he supposed to be more flustered?

01:00.990 --> 01:04.000
Or does this mean I'm not attractive enough?

01:24.870 --> 01:32.670
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

02:31.710 --> 02:35.170
<b>Episode 6
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask</b>

02:35.660 --> 02:38.050
And how are you all doing today?

02:38.560 --> 02:40.550
It's me, Carocaro!

02:40.820 --> 02:44.540
Let's go over the topic of 
the Magic Chevalier again!

02:45.020 --> 02:48.690
The Magic Chevalier is a magic 
sword-fighting tournament

02:48.690 --> 02:50.560
held between three sorcery academies.

02:50.930 --> 02:53.430
First-year students will compete 
in the rookie bracket.

02:53.430 --> 02:57.570
Second-year students and higher will 
participate in the main tournament.

02:57.570 --> 03:03.840
Usually, 16 contestants are selected 
from each of the three academies.

03:03.840 --> 03:08.000
But since last year's winner 
was our own Rebecca Bradley,

03:08.350 --> 03:13.710
our academy gets to pick not just five, 
but six contestants!

03:13.710 --> 03:15.010
That's so lucky!

03:15.500 --> 03:19.040
They say overall, we're the strongest,

03:19.040 --> 03:21.970
but Diom is an academy that 
specializes in actual battle,

03:21.970 --> 03:25.510
while Mercross specializes 
in sorcery research.

03:25.510 --> 03:28.840
Many students there go on to become researchers.

03:28.840 --> 03:31.350
Well, anyway, we've all got our 
own particular strengths,

03:31.350 --> 03:33.780
so it should be a good competition.

03:33.780 --> 03:37.750
The organizational staff might be doing the 
non-glamorous job of supporting the faculty,

03:37.750 --> 03:40.520
but they are the unsung heroes.

03:40.520 --> 03:43.470
So, we're counting on you!

03:45.750 --> 03:48.940
Now, let's get right to the qualifiers.

03:48.220 --> 03:50.370
Ray, we've got to do our best!

03:49.300 --> 03:52.810
Let's assign you all your tasks!

03:52.810 --> 03:54.640
Yay! Fun fun!

03:52.970 --> 03:53.760
Huh?

03:55.630 --> 03:56.800
Miss Abbie!

03:57.390 --> 03:58.750
What is it, Ray?

03:58.750 --> 04:00.490
You know exactly what it is!

04:00.490 --> 04:03.550
Why is... why is that woman... here?!

04:03.790 --> 04:05.650
Oh, you mean Carol.

04:05.650 --> 04:08.370
She happened to be free, 
so I called her here.

04:08.370 --> 04:12.610
It's also my responsibility to select 
staff that will keep this academy safe.

04:12.610 --> 04:15.250
Then, I will assist you!

04:15.250 --> 04:17.200
But please, anyone but that woman!

04:17.550 --> 04:19.020
I understand how you feel, but...

04:19.020 --> 04:20.940
Miss Abbie, I'm sure you're also aware of this.

04:20.940 --> 04:23.360
She's the only person I can't handle. 
It's always been that way.

04:23.360 --> 04:26.010
And on top of it all, 
she has to be my homeroom teacher?

04:26.010 --> 04:27.660
Relax.

04:27.660 --> 04:31.380
Carol's brand of sorcery is 
very convenient to have.

04:31.660 --> 04:34.750
Plus, the students seem to like her, too.

04:35.150 --> 04:37.120
Th-That's...

04:37.430 --> 04:40.160
That's because they don't 
know her true nature!

04:40.160 --> 04:43.270
Anyway, please just fire her, 
the sooner the better!

04:45.390 --> 04:48.560
Did you really just say that, Ray?

04:49.560 --> 04:51.810
That makes me so sad.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.700
Miss Abbie!

04:56.700 --> 04:57.900
Wait!

04:59.240 --> 05:01.310
Sorry, but you'll have to give it up.

04:59.240 --> 05:02.440
Let me pet you like I used to!

05:01.310 --> 05:05.040
Despite being this way, 
she's actually quite a talented sorcerer.

05:10.110 --> 05:13.150
Who do you think is going to win this match?

05:13.150 --> 05:16.370
I don't know her name, but I think 
it will be the female student.

05:16.640 --> 05:20.170
Her code assembly rate and 
accuracy are on another level.

05:20.600 --> 05:24.870
The guy keeps trying to attack her with 
his sword, but he's still very clumsy.

05:25.400 --> 05:29.460
Based on her overall power, 
she's got the better chance here.

05:29.790 --> 05:30.630
Oh.

05:30.630 --> 05:31.980
Looks like they're done.

05:32.610 --> 05:34.510
That's a bit creepy.

05:34.510 --> 05:35.440
What is?

05:35.440 --> 05:37.110
Don't "what is" me!

05:37.110 --> 05:40.480
It's weird to know who will win a 
fight mere seconds after it started.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.510
Is it?

05:41.510 --> 05:43.470
The difference in their 
abilities was clear as day.

05:43.760 --> 05:48.010
At this level, three seconds is usually 
enough to determine how it will end.

05:48.370 --> 05:50.310
Creepy...

05:50.310 --> 05:51.980
Oh, this is the big one!

05:52.420 --> 05:54.420
Miss Amelia!

05:55.230 --> 05:57.160
Oh, it's over.

05:57.160 --> 05:59.670
Even I can tell!

06:02.080 --> 06:03.820
The winner is Amelia Rose.

06:04.320 --> 06:05.760
Six seconds!

06:05.760 --> 06:08.750
I know it's just an early round, 
but Amelia is truly amazing.

06:08.750 --> 06:10.790
Yes, however...

06:11.500 --> 06:13.360
Victory is obvious.

06:13.360 --> 06:15.350
But it doesn't look like that's 
what she's thinking about...

06:16.660 --> 06:21.090
She has the expression of someone 
handling a mundane task.

06:22.810 --> 06:25.660
We're expecting great 
things from you, Amelia.

06:25.660 --> 06:27.550
Yes, Father.

06:27.550 --> 06:29.720
You are the eldest daughter 
of House Rose,

06:29.720 --> 06:31.400
the leader of the three great houses.

06:31.400 --> 06:32.900
Compete like your life depends on it.

06:34.180 --> 06:35.250
I understand.

06:36.200 --> 06:38.000
Especially concerning Algren.

06:38.370 --> 06:41.560
Losing to Miss Ariane 
is out of the question.

06:43.390 --> 06:46.750
Never forget the position you're in.

06:47.060 --> 06:48.280
Understood?

06:48.280 --> 06:50.420
Yes, Father.

06:51.720 --> 06:54.220
Ariane Algren?

06:54.220 --> 06:55.470
Yes.

06:55.470 --> 06:59.110
Ariane has already been selected 
as one of Diom's representatives.

06:59.110 --> 07:00.970
That makes sense, too.

07:01.330 --> 07:04.970
Is she strong, this Ariane Algren?

07:05.370 --> 07:07.230
She is.

07:07.550 --> 07:12.080
Despite also coming from a great family, 
she and Amelia are a little different.

07:12.080 --> 07:13.400
How can I put it?

07:13.930 --> 07:16.070
To me she seems like the type who takes pride

07:16.070 --> 07:18.530
in being a noble, and can 
turn that into strength.

07:18.530 --> 07:20.020
Being a noble...

07:20.460 --> 07:24.300
I saw her practice once.

07:24.300 --> 07:27.670
Even though she's younger than me, 
her movements were truly marvelous.

07:27.670 --> 07:31.330
Like a majestic bird soaring across the sky!

07:33.040 --> 07:35.280
She's a formidable opponent,

07:35.280 --> 07:39.010
but I know Amelia will 
give her a good fight.

07:39.010 --> 07:41.510
Yes. That's what I believe.

07:41.510 --> 07:45.180
In any case, Miss Rebecca is going 
to take first place by a huge margin,

07:45.180 --> 07:47.680
just like last year!

07:47.680 --> 07:49.660
Oh, Dina.

07:55.360 --> 07:57.440
The winner is Amelia Rose.

07:57.440 --> 08:01.450
Having won all her matches, she has secured 
a spot for the Magic Chevalier!

08:01.450 --> 08:03.780
Wow, she's in first place!

08:03.780 --> 08:05.490
Amelia did it!

08:05.490 --> 08:08.170
Most of her fights were 
done in under ten seconds.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.760
But it looks like her opponent, Alium,

08:10.760 --> 08:12.960
made it through the qualifiers 
 in second place.

08:14.170 --> 08:16.890
I've never seen him like that.

08:16.890 --> 08:17.980
Is that right?

08:19.690 --> 08:22.170
Great work, Miss Amelia!

08:22.170 --> 08:23.240
Just as expected!

08:23.240 --> 08:24.660
Congratulations!

08:24.660 --> 08:25.800
Thank you.

08:27.210 --> 08:29.540
We'll be cheering for you 
in the main matches, too!

08:29.540 --> 08:31.120
We all will!

08:31.860 --> 08:36.620
<i>I need to meet everyone's expectations.</i>

08:37.360 --> 08:39.070
<i>My father's expectations.</i>

08:45.380 --> 08:47.120
<i>Here, take this.</i>

08:47.550 --> 08:50.020
<i>I'm sure it'll be useful some day.</i>

08:58.210 --> 08:59.330
Ray?

08:59.330 --> 09:00.680
What are you doing here?

09:00.680 --> 09:02.740
Congratulations on making 
it through the qualifiers.

09:02.740 --> 09:04.260
Thank yo—

09:04.260 --> 09:06.310
It was too easy, 
and it makes you uneasy.

09:07.740 --> 09:10.060
"Am I good enough like this?"

09:10.590 --> 09:12.320
That's what you're thinking.

09:14.010 --> 09:15.280
Do you want to become strong?

09:17.430 --> 09:22.280
Ariane is going to be in the rookie 
bracket of the Magic Chevalier.

09:22.280 --> 09:25.460
She's stronger than me...

09:26.560 --> 09:31.100
We have less than a month left until 
the tournament, but I could train you.

09:31.100 --> 09:33.220
Really? But you're—

09:33.220 --> 09:34.100
It's fine.

09:35.090 --> 09:39.260
Since I'll only be instructing, 
I won't need to release my abilities.

09:39.260 --> 09:42.710
My master also lent me this.

09:42.710 --> 09:44.070
What is that?

09:44.070 --> 09:46.700
The Ainsworth-style boot camp.

09:46.700 --> 09:49.810
This is what I used to 
build my own foundation.

09:49.810 --> 09:52.500
I completed it when I was little.

09:52.500 --> 09:53.550
I'll do it!

09:54.790 --> 09:56.480
That's the spirit!

09:56.960 --> 09:59.350
Then, follow me, Amelia!

09:59.670 --> 10:01.970
The path ahead is going to be brutal.

10:01.970 --> 10:05.530
But if you make it to the 
end, you can get stronger.

10:05.530 --> 10:06.790
So much stronger than you are now.

10:07.180 --> 10:07.920
Okay?

10:12.560 --> 10:17.590
<i>The first time I met Ariane was at one 
of the parties for the upper nobility.</i>

10:18.790 --> 10:21.190
Are you Amelia?

10:22.520 --> 10:24.890
I'm Ariane Algren.

10:25.330 --> 10:27.100
Want to come play with me?

10:43.240 --> 10:48.720
<i>Being the same age, we naturally 
became friends after that.</i>

10:49.070 --> 10:51.460
Let's go, Amelia!

10:51.460 --> 10:53.970
W-Wait for me!

10:55.090 --> 10:58.460
Amelia, this is a stag beetle.

10:58.940 --> 11:01.470
Its horn is so big!

11:07.030 --> 11:08.600
I won.

11:09.770 --> 11:11.300
<i>We had so much fun.</i>

11:11.300 --> 11:15.230
<i>I loved her with all my heart.</i>

11:19.860 --> 11:21.660
Is something the matter?

11:22.280 --> 11:28.360
Thank you for always playing with me.

11:29.990 --> 11:34.380
I'm also always grateful for you.

11:34.380 --> 11:36.170
Really?

11:36.170 --> 11:36.920
Yes.

11:37.460 --> 11:43.890
I do worry that you actually resent me for 
always dragging you all over the place...

11:43.890 --> 11:45.380
I'd never resent you!

11:45.770 --> 11:51.140
If it wasn't for you, 
I think I'd just be inside all the time.

11:51.620 --> 11:58.160
But you're the one who got 
me outside, so thank you!

12:02.150 --> 12:03.540
Amelia.

12:03.540 --> 12:06.900
We will always be friends.

12:08.630 --> 12:09.550
Yes.

12:09.900 --> 12:11.870
Always, always.

12:11.870 --> 12:14.170
Always, always, always.

12:15.320 --> 12:17.460
<i>We were so close, but...</i>

12:50.470 --> 12:53.790
<i>That was the last time we were really friends.</i>

12:54.750 --> 12:58.320
<i>No, Ariane has always stayed the same.</i>

12:58.800 --> 13:00.660
<i>It was me who changed.</i>

13:07.700 --> 13:09.600
<i>Being a noble.</i>

13:09.600 --> 13:11.610
<i>Being perceived as a noble.</i>

13:12.140 --> 13:15.710
<i>At some point I realized that it 
had become everything to me.</i>

13:16.710 --> 13:18.100
<i>In order to survive.</i>

13:18.960 --> 13:20.220
I need to win.

13:25.110 --> 13:28.090
It looks like Ray's not here yet.

13:28.090 --> 13:29.650
Good morning, Amelia.

13:35.220 --> 13:37.220
Ray. That is you, right?

13:37.220 --> 13:39.290
I am Master White.

13:40.160 --> 13:42.870
From here on, I am your instructor.

13:42.870 --> 13:44.930
You are a private in training.

13:45.190 --> 13:46.680
You answer with "ranger".

13:46.680 --> 13:47.470
Got it?!

13:47.830 --> 13:50.000
Uh? Huh?

13:50.200 --> 13:53.580
I said you answer with "ranger",
Private Amelia!

13:54.320 --> 13:55.880
First, I want you to lap the school,

13:55.880 --> 13:59.040
enter the Kafka Forest 
and then come back here.

13:59.040 --> 14:01.270
That's easily twenty kilometers,

14:01.270 --> 14:03.870
but you are not allowed to 
use any body enhancements!

14:03.870 --> 14:06.290
Twenty kilometers without body enhancements?

14:06.580 --> 14:07.530
What is the response?

14:07.860 --> 14:09.760
R-Ranger!

14:12.780 --> 14:16.870
Many sorcerers try to rely 
on body enhancement sorcery.

14:16.870 --> 14:20.540
However, in the end, you only have 
your own body to fall back on!

14:20.540 --> 14:22.840
No matter how strong your will might be,

14:22.840 --> 14:24.780
it's meaningless if your body cannot keep up!

14:27.070 --> 14:31.250
Today's routine was light, but we'll 
be going in earnest tomorrow.

14:32.160 --> 14:33.970
This was "light"?

14:34.240 --> 14:36.480
I said you answer with "ranger"!

14:37.780 --> 14:39.580
Ranger!

14:39.580 --> 14:40.070
Good!

14:45.620 --> 14:47.810
What's up with her?

14:47.810 --> 14:50.570
I guess she's doing Ray's special training.

14:50.570 --> 14:54.350
It seems she's being pushed quite 
hard from morning until evening.

14:54.350 --> 14:58.220
So that's why Ray was going out in 
the morning with that weird mask on.

14:58.220 --> 14:58.970
A mask?

14:58.970 --> 15:01.950
I was wondering why he 
needs that to go running.

15:01.950 --> 15:03.070
But now I get it.

15:03.070 --> 15:04.320
You do?

15:10.120 --> 15:12.530
I'm in Hell.

15:19.370 --> 15:20.680
Ariane!

15:21.590 --> 15:23.670
Wait, don't go!

15:30.450 --> 15:31.850
Amelia.

15:35.110 --> 15:37.280
E-Elisa?

15:37.560 --> 15:39.840
You seem so alone.

15:38.910 --> 15:41.070
Wai— Elisa!

15:42.120 --> 15:44.540
There, there.

15:42.800 --> 15:46.180
I-I'm stuck.

15:46.180 --> 15:48.550
Poor Amelia.

15:49.260 --> 15:50.710
Claris?!

15:50.710 --> 15:52.550
Huh? Why?!

15:53.610 --> 15:56.610
Is this... H-Heaven?

15:56.610 --> 15:58.010
Bunny bun.

15:57.250 --> 16:01.200
Amelia!

16:01.200 --> 16:05.250
Amelia!

16:12.780 --> 16:15.580
R-Ray, y-you're too close!

16:16.490 --> 16:17.580
Want a bite?

16:21.790 --> 16:24.370
Private Amelia! Time to report for duty!

16:24.370 --> 16:25.910
You have one minute to get ready.

16:26.220 --> 16:27.790
This can't be happening.

16:27.790 --> 16:29.430
Are you still sleeping?!

16:29.430 --> 16:32.410
I told you, you answer with "ranger"!

16:32.410 --> 16:33.370
Hurry up!

16:33.370 --> 16:34.890
I'll be waiting for you downstairs.

16:35.650 --> 16:36.890
Ray!

16:36.890 --> 16:37.550
Huh?

16:37.940 --> 16:41.070
What are you doing out here so early 
in the morning with that mask?!

16:41.070 --> 16:42.740
What am I doing?

16:42.740 --> 16:45.560
You mean the Ainsworth-style wake-up call?

16:45.560 --> 16:47.700
Also, I am not Ray.

16:48.080 --> 16:50.430
I am Master White!

16:50.810 --> 16:52.050
Honestly, Ray...

16:51.370 --> 16:53.930
I don't care about the official name for it!

16:53.930 --> 16:56.450
Just stop coming into the girls' dormitory!

16:56.450 --> 16:57.500
I see.

16:57.500 --> 17:00.800
My apologies for not being more 
considerate of the surroundings.

17:00.800 --> 17:05.430
But I must say that you both look 
very exquisite in your pajamas.

17:05.430 --> 17:07.190
I don't care what you 
think about that, either!

17:07.190 --> 17:08.300
Oh, my.

17:08.720 --> 17:10.600
Where do you think you're 
going, Private Amelia?!

17:10.600 --> 17:11.460
Oh, no!

17:12.460 --> 17:13.750
Is that...

17:13.750 --> 17:15.280
Miss Amelia?

17:15.280 --> 17:16.740
I see.

17:16.740 --> 17:19.090
We've got a runner this morning, huh?

17:19.090 --> 17:21.140
However, I am a pro chaser!

17:20.250 --> 17:21.590
Hey, Ray!

17:21.590 --> 17:22.320
Let's go!

17:22.320 --> 17:23.610
No!

17:22.940 --> 17:24.600
You won't get away!

17:23.790 --> 17:26.040
I was training on my own!

17:24.600 --> 17:25.910
See you later.

17:25.910 --> 17:27.790
I wasn't done with you!

17:31.900 --> 17:34.150
I can't believe she ran away again.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.580
Albert?

17:37.190 --> 17:38.360
Oh, Ray, it's you.

17:38.640 --> 17:40.250
Are you here all by yourself?

17:40.250 --> 17:41.850
Where's your usual group?

17:42.290 --> 17:45.330
Once in a while, I do like to be alone.

17:45.330 --> 17:46.630
I see.

17:48.100 --> 17:48.940
Hey.

17:49.620 --> 17:52.750
How can I become strong?

17:54.290 --> 17:57.930
To be honest, I still 
have doubt in my heart.

17:58.370 --> 18:00.370
I train every day,

18:01.030 --> 18:04.420
but trying to shake off this doubt 
is proving quite difficult.

18:05.940 --> 18:07.340
There's no need to rush.

18:07.820 --> 18:10.920
You've gotten stronger without
even knowing it.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.410
And I'm sure you'll get even stronger.

18:13.410 --> 18:14.850
So don't worry.

18:16.210 --> 18:17.520
You really think so?

18:18.080 --> 18:19.060
I do.

18:19.060 --> 18:20.550
I guarantee it.

18:22.530 --> 18:27.330
Hearing it from you makes me 
believe it will actually happen.

18:29.100 --> 18:31.090
I can't take this anymore!

18:31.090 --> 18:33.090
This assignment is way too hard!

18:33.090 --> 18:36.720
Your hair is all messed up.

18:36.720 --> 18:38.880
Let me fix it for you.

18:39.590 --> 18:41.760
I'm so sorry, Elisa.

18:41.760 --> 18:44.770
I'd prefer a thank you over an apology.

18:45.770 --> 18:47.310
Thank you.

18:48.720 --> 18:50.420
Have you seen Amelia?

18:50.420 --> 18:51.610
Amelia?

18:51.610 --> 18:52.760
We haven't seen her.

18:52.760 --> 18:53.950
I see.

18:54.480 --> 18:57.750
Well, you can't run from me, Private Amelia!

19:06.260 --> 19:08.740
I found you, Private Amelia!

19:08.960 --> 19:11.350
Hey, you can't run in here!

19:14.990 --> 19:16.500
This is too hard.

19:21.440 --> 19:23.330
H-How did you find me here?

19:23.330 --> 19:24.910
I used my abilities a bit.

19:24.910 --> 19:26.180
You went that far?

19:26.180 --> 19:30.360
Finding a private on the run is also 
the instructor's responsibility.

19:31.750 --> 19:34.350
I wasn't trying to run away, you know?

19:34.350 --> 19:37.160
I just wanted to be alone for a little bit.

19:37.160 --> 19:38.150
Worthless excuses!

19:38.560 --> 19:41.970
For running away twice today, 
a penalty will be added!

19:41.970 --> 19:45.040
I'll also be explaining your self 
training plan, which starts tomorrow!

19:43.000 --> 19:45.030
My hand!

19:45.040 --> 19:45.590
This hand?

19:45.590 --> 19:48.190
I will not be releasing it until 
we reach the training area.

19:48.190 --> 19:49.570
You can count on that!

19:50.850 --> 19:52.980
Let's go, Private Amelia!

19:51.920 --> 19:54.310
I don't want to!

19:54.310 --> 19:55.370
The only answer is "ranger"!

19:55.370 --> 19:58.900
R-Ranger!

19:57.300 --> 19:59.000
It's not easy...

19:59.000 --> 20:01.080
...for her, either.

20:02.190 --> 20:04.840
You want to form an Amelia cheering squad?

20:05.200 --> 20:06.160
Yes!

20:06.160 --> 20:07.860
I humbly ask for your approval!

20:07.860 --> 20:10.380
But why should we do this?

20:10.380 --> 20:13.220
Fighting when you feel the presence of those 
cheering you on...

20:13.220 --> 20:15.660
is a big help in itself.

20:15.660 --> 20:19.110
However, I also believe that the 
loudness of their cheers is also important.

20:19.110 --> 20:22.790
I believe that we, with the most 
impressive bulk at this academy,

20:22.790 --> 20:26.540
could definitely become the 
very best cheering squad!

20:26.540 --> 20:29.200
Hm, now I see.

20:29.390 --> 20:31.200
An Amelia cheering squad...

20:31.200 --> 20:33.370
What could be better than that?

20:33.370 --> 20:37.720
Let's lend our superior bulk 
and cheer on Amelia, everyone!

20:37.720 --> 20:41.190
Hell yeah!

20:41.190 --> 20:42.340
Ray.

20:42.340 --> 20:43.010
Yes!

20:43.960 --> 20:46.010
Here's what you asked for.

20:46.010 --> 20:47.970
Thank you.

20:47.970 --> 20:51.000
I will not ask how you plan on using that.

20:51.290 --> 20:54.010
You stay on your path of conviction!

20:54.520 --> 20:55.440
Yes, sir!

21:06.280 --> 21:07.790
Who was that?

21:08.520 --> 21:10.070
Well, whatever.

21:17.280 --> 21:19.470
That was amazing, Amelia!

21:19.470 --> 21:21.710
You beat your previous time.

21:22.890 --> 21:26.440
Thank you for coming out with 
me so early in the morning.

21:26.440 --> 21:28.360
It's the least we can do.

21:28.360 --> 21:30.350
Claris and I were talking.

21:30.350 --> 21:33.200
We were wondering if there was 
anything we could do to help.

21:33.860 --> 21:35.190
Thank you both.

21:35.190 --> 21:37.850
Good job, Private Amelia.

21:37.850 --> 21:38.880
Ranger!

21:38.880 --> 21:41.080
I'm training as hard as I can!

21:41.850 --> 21:42.690
Huh?

21:43.680 --> 21:45.540
Who...

21:45.540 --> 21:46.830
...was that?

21:47.100 --> 21:48.660
No idea.

21:49.580 --> 21:52.580
Become beautiful, become beautiful.

21:52.580 --> 21:54.340
You have to say it, too, Dina.

21:54.340 --> 21:55.980
I do?

21:56.550 --> 21:58.970
Good work so early in the morning, Senpais!

22:00.740 --> 22:04.170
Isn't that Diom's uniform?

22:04.170 --> 22:06.750
But didn't she just call us senpai?

22:07.390 --> 22:08.660
Oh, my.

22:09.320 --> 22:10.660
<i>It's perfect.</i>

22:10.660 --> 22:13.150
<i>I'm currently absolutely without flaw.</i>

22:13.150 --> 22:15.690
<i>But the real trial is yet to come.</i>

22:16.100 --> 22:18.780
<i>Off to Diom Academy!</i>

22:26.630 --> 22:28.660
That's a cardboard box for you.

22:28.660 --> 22:30.840
Nobody has noticed me.

22:32.920 --> 22:36.650
Big sister, where are you?

22:52.790 --> 22:53.530
Huh?

23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
