23:49.990 --> 23:54.990
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.000 --> 23:54.580
Umm... This is the preview of the next episode of 
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer Shall Rule the World</i>!

23:54.990 --> 23:58.920
Infiltrating Diom! The target is a 
smart and beautiful young lady.

23:58.920 --> 24:02.150
A very volatile teatime is about to begin!

24:02.150 --> 24:06.570
"The Girl Who Became the World's Strongest 
Sorcerer Infiltrates a Sorcery Academy".

24:05.460 --> 24:09.960
<b>Episode 7
The Girl Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Infiltrates a Sorcery Academy</b>

